Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:22:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Observe owner receipt clients in handoff process
 samples

Dispatch CI passed the release shards and original handoff scenarios, but the new long-drain proof exposed a stale process sampler: current workers carry their task identity in environment, not chat argv. Export only the task identifier in namespace observations and retain legacy argv and duplicate-root detection. Proof: sampler regression failed 0 != 1 before fix; focused canonical suites pass after fix. Full namespace validation remains in dispatch CI.
---
